<!--
  KNQA document types: the vocabulary behind Describe > Type (dc.type) in submission.
  Loaded automatically as the "knqa_types" vocabulary (see dspace/config/KNQA_CONFIG.md).

  - Groups have selectable="false": only the types inside them can be chosen.
  - Only the type label is stored (vocabulary.plugin.knqa_types.hierarchy.store = false).
  - hasNote = "COAR: <type>", the COAR resource type the label is exported as through OAI-PMH
    (oai_openaire). After adding or renaming a type, run  python3 knqa/knqa_types_to_oai.py
    from the repository root to update oai_openaire.xsl.
  - To add a type: copy a <node> inside the right group, give it a new unique id and label.
  - Never change an id once items use it; labels can be renamed (then update existing items).
-->
